摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin that checks npm packages before install — 22 supply-chain rules, deep tarball scans, CI gates, local-first.","id":"gh:1339554434","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"npm-safe-forDSH","slug":"nisconder/npm-safe-forDSH","topics":["agent-tools","ai","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dependency-security","dsh","dsh-plugin","llm","malware-detection","npm","npm-security","package-security","scanner","security","security-scanner","sqlite","static-analysis","supply-chain","tool-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin that checks npm packages before install — 22 supply-chain rules, deep tarbal"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"l scans, CI gates, local-first."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# npm-safe for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Give AI agents evidence before they choose an npm package.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**14 agent tools · 22 security checks · integrity-verified deep scans · local SQLite cache**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Install · See what it catches · Tool catalog · 中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"`npm-safe-forDSH` provides supply-chain security checking tools for\nDeepSeek Harness. It lets an\nage"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"nt inspect npm package metadata and published tarballs **before** an install,\nthen returns evidence,"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" a risk level, and an explainable score inside the same\nconversation."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The plugin registers tools that an agent can choose to call. It does not\nintercept shell commands or"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" automatically block every `npm`, `pnpm`, `yarn`,\nor DSH plugin installation. Configure your agent w"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"orkflow to require a check\nof the exact version before installing; enforce a mandatory install polic"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"y\nin your host or CI separately. A `ci_scan` failure is a tool result that its\ncaller must act on."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> If this makes your agent workflow safer, please **Star the repository**. It\n> helps other DSH user"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"s find an independent security tool."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 30-second install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Restart a running profile after installation. Then ask:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"For a quick metadata-only check:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The plugin is declared as a native DSH bundle, so the official `dsh plugin`\ncommand installs the pac"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"kage and activates its `cordis.patch.yml` layer.\n`--allow-build=better-sqlite3` grants build permiss"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ion only to the SQLite\ndriver used for the local cache; pnpm continues to block install scripts from"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"\nother dependencies. Your selected DSH model provider must already be\nconfigured; a DeepSeek API key"},{"id":"p15s5","text":" is only required when DeepSeek is the selected\nprovider."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## What it catches"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Signal | Metadata scan | Deep scan |\n|---|:---:|:---:|\n| Suspicious lifecycle scripts and install "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"hooks | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Typosquatting, abandoned packages, risky maintainers | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Non-standard regi"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"stries and remote binaries | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Tarball integrity mismatch and unsafe archive paths | — | ✅ |"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"\n| Obfuscated code, embedded secrets, shell/network execution | — | ✅ |\n| Native binaries, WebAssemb"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"ly, oversized or truncated content | — | ✅ |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Metadata scans are fast and remain the default. Set `deep: true` to download\nthe same-origin publish"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ed tarball, verify npm integrity metadata, and inspect\nbounded source content entirely in memory."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Why use it in an agent"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Typical agent workflow | With npm-safe-forDSH |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Installs first and audits later | Checks before the install decision |\n| Trusts package names and "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"download counts | Evaluates maintainers, scripts, provenance signals, and content |\n| Returns a pass"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"/fail with little context | Returns findings, evidence, severity, score, and recommendations |\n| Rep"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"eats registry traffic | Uses a local SQLite cache and rate limiting |\n| Checks one package manually "},{"id":"p22s5","text":"| Supports batch checks, watchlists, refresh jobs, and CI gates |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 14 agent tools"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `check_package` | Check one package, with optional `version`, `forceRefresh`, and `deep` |\n| `chec"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"k_packages` | Rate-limited batch checking |\n| `search_packages` | Search the npm registry |\n| `watch"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"_add` / `watch_remove` / `watch_list` | Manage a persistent watchlist |\n| `rules_list` / `rule_enabl"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"e` / `rule_disable` | Inspect and toggle rules |\n| `rule_set_severity` | Override a rule severity |\n"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"| `settings_get` / `settings_set` | Read or update engine settings |\n| `ci_scan` | Scan a project's "},{"id":"p25s6","text":"dependencies as a security gate |\n| `refresh_all` | Refresh the watchlist as a background DSH job |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Security model"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- Core detection is deterministic and local-first; no package source is sent\nto an external LLM by d"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"efault.\n- Deep scans reject cross-origin tarballs and enforce archive size, file count,\ndecompressio"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"n, path, and scanned-text limits.\n- Findings are evidence, not a guarantee that a package is safe. R"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"eview high\nimpact packages and pin versions in production.\n- See the complete scanner rules and\nsecu"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"mpact packages and pin versions in production.\n- See the complete scanner rules and\nsecurity policy."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Use the engine directly"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Develop from source"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Requires Node.js 24.9+ and Corepack."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The repository pins a release tarball of `@npm-safe/core@1.1.2` under `vendor/`\nthrough a workspace "},{"id":"p34s2","text":"override. The scanner source is maintained only in\n`nisconder/npm-safe`. `packages/core`\nis a small "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"compatibility facade, with no copied scanner, database, or registry\nimplementation. See updating the"},{"id":"p34s4","text":" shared core for the\nreproducible `--core-tarball` workflow and the release order."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Live registry smoke tests:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The workspace contains `@npm-safe/core-dsh` and the\n`@npm-safe/dsh-tool-npm-safe` bundle. DSH peer\np"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ackages are aligned to the `0.2.1-rc.5` family, and the bundle declares\n`engines.dsh` as `>=0.2.1-rc"},{"id":"p37s3","text":".5 <0.3.0`; upgrades must keep the peers and that\nrange aligned while DeepSeek Harness is in develop"},{"id":"p37s4","text":" upgrades must keep the peers and that\nrange aligned while DeepSeek Harness is in developer preview."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- Plugin package and examples\n- Engine API\n- Architecture\n- Scanner rules\n- Contributing"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"This project depends on the shared engine from\n`nisconder/npm-safe` for DeepSeek\nHarness. It is an i"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"ndependent community project and is not affiliated with or\nendorsed by DeepSeek."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Apache-2.0 — Copyright 2026 Nisconder, InfiniteScope, Escap1ng, StoryBegins."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
